---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Methodology & AI Telemetry">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <div class="mb-12 text-center relative">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -top-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500/10 via-purple-500/10 to-blue-500/10 blur-3xl -z-10 rounded-full"></div>
    <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-500/20 font-semibold mb-4 inline-block">
      System Architecture
    </span>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-gray-200 to-gray-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
      Methodology & Telemetry
    </h1>
    <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-xl mx-auto text-base">
      How OddsPulse Labs aggregates data, processes macro signals, and calculates probabilistic consensus for global events.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Content Sections -->
  <div class="grid gap-6">
    
    <!-- Section 1 -->
    <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-gray-800/80 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#131B2E] to-[#0D1322] shadow-xl">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 font-semibold border border-cyan-500/30">01</span>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-100">Data Ingestion & Signal Extraction</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Our automated agents continuously monitor thousands of global data points, including academic pre-prints, macroeconomic indicators, patent filings, and geopolitical statements. Raw signals are parsed, tokenized, and weighted based on historical source reliability.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 2 -->
    <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-gray-800/80 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#131B2E] to-[#0D1322] shadow-xl">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 font-semibold border border-cyan-500/30">02</span>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-100">Probabilistic Consensus Engine</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Rather than relying on single-point predictions, OddsPulse synthesizes multi-model ensemble consensus. Each probability score represents a normalized statistical outlook calculated by weighing technological velocity curves against regulatory and supply-chain friction.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 3 -->
    <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-gray-800/80 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#131B2E] to-[#0D1322] shadow-xl">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-400 font-semibold border border-cyan-500/30">03</span>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-100">Dynamic Telemetry Updates</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Market conditions shift rapidly. Our autonomous pipeline recalibrates odds scores and calculates weekly percentage trends (deltas) to reflect emerging breakthroughs, policy shifts, and macro volatility in real time.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- Call to Action / Back -->
  <div class="mt-12 text-center">
    <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors bg-cyan-950/40 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl border border-cyan-500/30 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(6,182,212,0.1)]">
      &larr; Back to Live Markets Feed
    </a>
  </div>
</Layout>
